---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Pic from '../components/Pic.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const U = '/wp-content/uploads/2024/10';
const L = SITE.links;
const stockMail =
  'mailto:donate@ablebodied.org?subject=Stock%20donation&body=I%20pledge%20to%20donate%20%0A%0A%23%20of%20shares%3A%20%0ATicker%3A%0A%0APlease%20send%20me%20transfer%20instructions.';
---

<Base title="Donate" description="Donate to Able Bodied Inc., a 501(c)(3) nonprofit: PayPal, card, stock, employer matching, Zelle or Venmo.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="heading">Donate using PayPal, Debit or Credit Card</h1>
      <div class="btn-wrap"><a class="btn big" href={L.paypal}>DONATE CASH</a></div>
      <hr class="divider" />

      <h2 class="heading">Donate Stock (Avoid capital gains taxes)</h2>
      <div class="text">
        <p>You can donate stock, get a tax deduction for the full value of the stock, and pay no capital gains taxes,. If you live in California and have highly appreciated stock, you can get almost 80% of your donation back as tax savings. Just send us your donation pledge and we will send you instructions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-wrap"><a class="btn big" href={stockMail}>DONATE STOCK</a></div>
      <hr class="divider" />

      <h2 class="heading">Employer Matching (highest impact)</h2>
      <div class="text">
        <p>Many companies offer matching of charitable contributions by their employees. Your money can go much farther when you take advantage of this program as typically, employers match dollar-for-dollar your contribution. Please contact your company’s HR/Benefits department and ask them if they offer this program. Look us up under Able Bodied Inc which is already registered with <a href="https://benevity.com/">Benevity</a> and <a href={L.guidestar}>GuideStar</a> (which has awarded us with their Gold Seal of Transparency) and can take online employee match donations directly and usually through your company’s intranet (ex. <a href={L.benevity}>Google’s Benevity portal</a> (link only works on Google corp account)). If your company is not set up to make a match to us, please email us at info@ablebodied.org as we can find a way to ensure you get the match approved.</p>
        <p>IMPORTANT NOTE: Google matches stock donations and donations from Donor Advised Funds, so you should be able to combine stock donations with employee matching.</p>
      </div>
      <hr class="divider spaced" />

      <h2 class="heading">Donate on your mobile phone</h2>
      <div class="phones">
        <div>
          <Pic src={`${U}/Screenshot-2024-10-12-at-4.48.48-PM.png`} alt="Zelle QR code" sizes="320px" />
          <div class="text">
            <p><b>Preferred method</b> as No Fees. Can open zelle app and send to</p>
            <p><b>e-mail:</b> {SITE.donateEmail}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href={L.paypal}><Pic src={`${U}/Screenshot-2024-10-18-at-4.10.15-PM.png`} alt="PayPal QR code" sizes="320px" /></a>
          <a href={L.paypal} class="paypal">PayPal</a>
          <div class="text center"><p>1.9% service fee</p></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href={L.venmo}><Pic src={`${U}/Screenshot-2024-10-18-at-4.37.22-PM.png`} alt="Venmo QR code for @AbleBodiedInc" sizes="320px" /></a>
          <div class="text center"><p>1.9% service fee</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="org">
        <p>Able Bodied Inc. is a nonprofit, tax-exempt charitable organization (tax ID number {SITE.ein}) under Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code. Donations are tax-deductible as allowed by law.</p>
        <p>Organization Name: Able Bodied Inc.</p>
        <p>EIN: {SITE.ein}</p>
        <p>
          Mailing Address: Able Bodied Inc. 1968 S. Coast Hwy #3742 Laguna Beach CA 92651<br />
          Email: {SITE.donateEmail}<br />
          Web Site Address: https://ablebodied.org/
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .btn.big {
    font-size: 23px;
    padding: 15px 30px;
  }
  .heading {
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .spaced {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .phones {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 20px 10px 30px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .phones {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .phones :global(img) {
    max-width: 320px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
  }
  .paypal {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    font: italic 800 34px/1 Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #003087;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .org {
    color: #000;
    font-size: 19.2px;
  }
</style>
